 "notes": "All five kinds kept. DAC/amp combo cut from 14 to 10 models plus Chord and RME archetypes (dropped FiiO K19, KA11, Topping DX1 II, xDuoo XD05 Pro); old Chord Hugo 2/Mojo 2 moved into the Chord archetype, Qutest into its own. Portable, dongle and Bluetooth forms as types. Headphone amp kept 6 old models. Master clock and Bluetooth adapter stay kind-level with no models. Left out (no retrieved page): Topping, FiiO and iFi archetypes (no reference page found), JDS Labs Atom, Schiit Jotunheim, Burson, Cavalli, Mytek, dCS Vivaldi clock, Benchmark DAC1 year (not on page). Chord, dCS, RME and Musical Fidelity brand facts from knowledge."
